# Copy to .env (never commit .env). Names only: fill in the values you need.
# Generated by scripts/migrate.py from the source repos' .env.example files.
# [05]/[06]/[08]/[09] say which source repo uses the key; module numbers in comments are
# that repo's numbering;
# docs/content-inventory.csv maps them to course modules. Most notebooks need only OPENAI_API_KEY.

# [01] OpenAI — read from .env by module 05 (reasoning / model selection); module 04 notebook 01 asks for it at a getpass prompt
# [02] OpenAI - modules 01, 02 (via LangChain's ChatOpenAI), 03 (01_openai_gpt_4o_mini), 04 (02_multimodal_openai_gpt_4o, incl. Whisper transcription) and 06. The notebooks set it with os.environ.
# [03] OpenAI chat models and embeddings - used by almost every notebook
# [04] OpenAI - every notebook that calls a chat model uses aied_helpers.get_openai_llm(model="gpt-4o-mini"): modules 01 (LLM section), 02 (chatbot), 05, 06 (02_LangGraph_Interrupt_Primitive, 03_HITL_Patterns), 07, 08, 09 and 11 (read implicitly by ChatOpenAI).
# [05] OpenAI: embeddings and chat models in most notebooks, and helpers.get_openai_llm()
# [06] OpenAI chat models: most notebooks, the from-scratch agents and aied_helpers get_openai_llm()
# [08] OpenAI chat models: most notebooks (ChatOpenAI), the from-scratch multi-agent notebook, src/helpers get_openai_llm()
# [09] OpenAI: chat and embeddings in most notebooks, the anthology helpers, and helpers.get_openai_llm()
# [10] OpenAI: lesson-3 walkthrough (01/02), lesson-5 chatbot, Wikipedia assistants, Educative servers' clients, the EC2 research server (04 project 08) and helpers.get_openai_llm()
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# [01] Google Gemini — module 04 notebook 01 asks for it at a getpass prompt (optional; the Gemini half of that notebook)
# [02] Google Gemini - module 03 (02_google_gemini_1_5_flash), module 04 (01_multimodal_google_gemini) and the module 04 exercise.
# [03] Google Gemini via langchain-google-genai - modules/01 03_Commercial_LLMs_with_LangChain, modules/02 02_LLM_vs_ChatModel
# [05] Google Gemini vision model for image captioning (11/02)
# [06] Google Gemini: model-integration (module 04), tool-calling-vs-ReAct (module 03), routing and evaluator-optimizer notebooks
# [10] Gemini via LangChain: MCP Essential clients (03 projects 01, 02) and mcp_a2a_agentic_rag (05)
GOOGLE_API_KEY=

